{"originalLanguage":"en","title":"Caramelldansen","artist":"Caramella Girls","date":"2026-07-14","sourceId":"YzJm-mk52WM:009","sourceHash":"13dd3dba2459be416004118057fe4ef4f0d0474985cb5024d064c3bb45c299e3","duration":180.92,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":34.3,"end":37.38,"text":"We wonder, are you ready to join us now?","translation":"우리와 함께할 준비가 됐어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":37.48,"end":40.24,"text":"Hands in the air, we will show you how","translation":"두 손을 높이 들어 우리가 보여 줄게","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":40.44,"end":41.68,"text":"Come and try","translation":"와서 한번 해 봐","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":42.64,"end":44.92,"text":"Caramell will be your guide (be your guide)","translation":"카라멜이 이끌어 줄게 이끌어 줄게","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":45.9,"end":48.66,"text":"So come on, move your hips, sing wa-ah-ah","translation":"자 허리를 흔들며 와아아 노래해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":48.66,"end":51.76,"text":"Look at YouTube clips, do it, la-la-la","translation":"유튜브 영상을 보고 라라라 따라 해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":52.26,"end":53.32,"text":"You and me","translation":"너와 나","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":53.68,"end":55.58,"text":"Can sing this melody","translation":"이 멜로디를 부를 수 있어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":56.58,"end":58.02,"text":"(Ooh-wa-ooh-wa ah-oh)","translation":"우와 우와 아오","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":58.02,"end":59.1,"text":"Dance to the beat","translation":"박자에 맞춰 춤춰","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":59.1,"end":60.92,"text":"Wave your hands together","translation":"두 손을 함께 흔들어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":60.92,"end":61.96,"text":"Come feel the heat","translation":"이 열기를 느껴 봐","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":61.96,"end":63.16,"text":"Forever and forever","translation":"영원히 또 영원히","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":63.16,"end":65.02,"text":"Listen and learn","translation":"듣고 배워 봐","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":65.02,"end":66.54,"text":"It is time for prancing","translation":"이제 신나게 뛰놀 시간이야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start"